+## Version 8.5.1
+
+Unreleased
+
+-   Shell completion no longer treats `#` as the start of a comment when
+    splitting the command line, so arguments containing `#` complete
+    correctly.
+
 ## Version 8.5.0
 
 Released 2026-08-24
